BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Persona
DTSTART:20250501T023000Z
DTEND:20250501T040500Z
DTSTAMP:20250501T023000Z
UID:fgJPWveqms
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 83 mins (1h23m)\n\nPresented by The Swedish Club and
  Greg Olson Productions The Magic Lantern of Ingmar Bergman This pinnacle 
 of mind-bending cinema has spawned decades of speculation and thousands of
  written words. A famous actress (the resplendent Liv Ullman) goes silent\
 , and she’s tended by a nurse (Bibi Andersson) on a lonely island. The n
 urse spews tales of emotional and sexual revelation. Ullman listens\, says
  nothing. Is she feeding on Andersson’s life force? Are they actually ea
 ch other? Is there someone else on the island?\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/pro
 grams-and-events/the-magic-lantern-of-ingmar-bergman/persona
LOCATION:\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
