 mer about a gay YA novelist (James McArdle\, “Mare of Easttown”) who m
 ust look after four aging women left in his care. Opening Night Tickets: $
 78 Members | $88 Non-MembersOpening Night VIP Tickets: $360 Members: Make
  sure to sign in to your SIFF account before selecting tickets. Note: SIFF
  parties are for ages 21+\, and IDs will be checked at the door. No refund
 s will be issued for tickets purchased with an invalid ID.\n\nhttps://www.
 siff.net/festival/four-mothers
