DTEND:20250516T215000Z
DTSTAMP:20250516T201500Z
UID:njeMQhcyUJ
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 85 mins (1h25m)\n\nLati\, a first-generation Malian 
 migrant\, turns to rap to overcome the death of her father. Determined to 
 overcome her fears of performing and to confront her mom’s opposition\, 
 a new world opens up when she learns how to tap into her frustration and a
 nger to create empowering\, liberating rhymes.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/fes
 tival/beef
LOCATION:\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
