 emains mostly untouched by the modern world\, this is an earnest and movi
 ng tale of Marcielle\, a young victim of abuse who yearns to find a way ou
 t of a hostile home and a village that has resisted change for generations
 .\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/manas
LOCATION:\, 305 Harrison Street
