DESCRIPTION:Duration: 101 mins (1h41m)\n\nFilm essayist and SIFF alum Alex
 andre O. Philippe (78/52\, Lynch/Oz) calls upon five horror luminaries—S
 tephen King and Takashi Miike among them—to discuss the impact 1974’s 
 seminal The Texas Chain Saw Massacre had upon their lives and careers. Sw
 ap your leather face for your thinking cap at the May 16 screening\, where
  BoneBat Comedy of Horrors Film Fest will be giving away goodies via trivi
 a!\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/festival/chain-reactions
LOCATION:\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
